# Environment / secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.*.example
# .env.testing carries no real secrets: fixed local-only database passwords
# matching docker/postgres/init and a throwaway APP_KEY. It is committed so
# `composer ci:check` works the same for every clone and in CI.
!.env.testing

